<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Index on INFINI Pizza</title><link>https://pizza.rs/tags/index/</link><description>Recent content in Index on INFINI Pizza</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://pizza.rs/tags/index/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Create a document</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/create/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/create/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="create-a-document">
 Create a document
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#create-a-document">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Creates a new document.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Insert a JSON document into the &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code> collection:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /my-collection/_doc
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;message&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;GET /search HTTP/1.1 200 1070000&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;org&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;infini&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The API returns the following result:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:my-collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;created&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_shards&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;total&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: 2, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;successful&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: 1, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;failed&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="m">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The API supports passing a customized UUID as the document identify, eg:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /my-collection/_doc/news_001
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;message&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;GET /search HTTP/1.1 200 1070000&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;org&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;infini&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The keyed form answers with the user key as &lt;code>_key&lt;/code>:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Create an index</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/create/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/create/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="create-an-index">
 Create an index
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#create-an-index">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Creates a new index under a collection.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>The following request creates a new index called &lt;code>my-index&lt;/code> under collection
&lt;code>my-namespace:my-collection&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PUT /my-namespace:my-collection/_index/my-index
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PUT /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, string) The collection which the index belongs to.&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, string) Name of the index you wish to create.&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Delete an index</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/delete/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/delete/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="delete-an-index">
 Delete an index
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#delete-an-index">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Deletes an existing index under a collection.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>The following request deletes the index called &lt;code>my-index&lt;/code> under collection
&lt;code>my-namespace:my-collection&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">DELETE /my-namespace:my-collection/_index/my-index
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">DELETE /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, string) The collection which the index will be removed from.&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, string) Name of the index you wish to delete.&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Get collection index</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/collection/get_index/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/collection/get_index/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="get-collection-index">
 Get collection index
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#get-collection-index">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>See the following documents:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get/">Get index&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_alias/">Get index alias&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_mapping/">Get index mapping&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_settings/">Get index settings&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Get index</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="get-index">
 Get index
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#get-index">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Returns information about one or more indices&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Get the information of all indices:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /_index
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Get the information of the index named &lt;code>my-index&lt;/code> under collection &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /my-collection/_index/my-index
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /_index
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/&amp;lt;index&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path Parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>target&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, String) Comma-separated, names of the collections to specify (wildcard supported)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>index&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, String) Comma-separated, names of the indices to get (wildcard supported)&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Get index mapping</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_mapping/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_mapping/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="get-index-mapping">
 Get index mapping
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#get-index-mapping">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Returns mapping information about one or more indices under the specified collection.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Get the mapping information of the &lt;code>my-index&lt;/code> index under collection &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /my-collection/_index/my-index/_mapping
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/&amp;lt;index&amp;gt;/_mapping
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/_mapping
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path Parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>target&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, String) Comma-separated, names of the collections to specify (wildcard supported)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>index&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Optional, String) Comma-separated, names of the indices to get (wildcard supported)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Get index settings</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_settings/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/get_settings/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="get-index-settings">
 Get index settings
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#get-index-settings">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Returns setting information about one or more indices under the specified collection.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Get the setting information of the &lt;code>my-index&lt;/code> index under collection &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /my-collection/_index/my-index/_settings
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/&amp;lt;index&amp;gt;/_settings
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_index/_settings
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path Parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>target&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, String) Comma-separated, names of the collections to specify (wildcard supported)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;code>index&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Optional, String) Comma-separated, names of the indices to get (wildcard supported)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Index</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/index/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="index">
 Index
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#index">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>An index is a specialized data structure designed to improve search performance
by efficiently organizing and storing data for quick retrieval. Each collection
has a default index called &lt;code>default&lt;/code>. You can create additional indices, each
tailored to specific use cases to enhance search speed.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>An index can manage various aspects such as &lt;code>mappings&lt;/code>, &lt;code>settings&lt;/code>, and &lt;code>aliases&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>Mappings: Define the schema of the index layout, specifying how fields in the
documents are indexed and stored. This includes data types and analyzers used
for text fields.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Fetch a document</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/fetch/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/fetch/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="fetch-a-document">
 Fetch a document
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#fetch-a-document">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Retrieve an existing document by specifying its unique identifier.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Fetch a document from the &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code> collection with customized uuid &lt;code>news_001&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /my-collection/_doc/news_001
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The API returns the following result:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:my-collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_key&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;news_001&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;found&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: true,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;source&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;message&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;GET /search HTTP/1.1 200 1070000&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;org&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;infini&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>As you can see, the customized uuid are represented as &lt;code>_key&lt;/code> within the document,
and there is also a &lt;code>_id&lt;/code> returned with value &lt;code>0,0&lt;/code>,
this is the internal id generated by Pizza, and it is guaranteed to be unique,
so you can also fetch this document by this value like this:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Replace a document</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/replace/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/replace/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="replace-a-document">
 Replace a document
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#replace-a-document">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Replace an existing document by specifying its unique identifier and the new content.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Replace a document &lt;code>news_001&lt;/code> of the collection &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code> with new content:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">PUT /my-collection/_doc/news_001
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;message&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;GET /search HTTP/1.1 200 1070000&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;org&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;infinilabs&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The API returns as following result:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>:&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_key&amp;#34;&lt;/span>:&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;news_001&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>:&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;updated&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>After the document modification, If you perform the fetch request:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /my-collection/_doc/news_001
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>It returns an updated document like:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:my-collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_key&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;news_001&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;found&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: true,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;source&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;message&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;GET /search HTTP/1.1 200 1070000&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;org&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;infinilabs&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The replacement happens in place: the document keeps its original &lt;code>_id&lt;/code>, and the
index entries of the old version are rebuilt under the same &lt;code>_id&lt;/code>. Since this is
a full replacement, fields that are omitted from the request body are cleared.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Partial update a document</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/partial_update/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/partial_update/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="partial-update-a-document">
 Partial update a document
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#partial-update-a-document">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Sometimes we may only need to update a portion of the fields of a document.
A partial update fetches the stored document, merges the partial &lt;code>doc&lt;/code> body,
applies the ordered &lt;code>ops&lt;/code> operators, and replaces the document in place under
its original &lt;code>_id&lt;/code> — the new values are visible to search immediately.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Update the &lt;code>org.id&lt;/code> field of the document with system id &lt;code>0,0&lt;/code> in the
collection &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code>:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Delete a document</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/delete/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/delete/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="delete-a-document">
 Delete a document
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#delete-a-document">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Delete a specific document from the specified collection by specifying its unique identifier.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Delete the document &lt;code>0,0&lt;/code> from collection &lt;code>my-collection&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">DELETE /my-collection/_doc/0,0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The API returns the following result:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_version&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: 0,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;deleted&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Deleting a document again (or fetching it after deletion) answers
&lt;code>404&lt;/code> with &lt;code>&amp;quot;result&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;not_found&amp;quot;&lt;/code> — the delete itself still succeeds
and reports &lt;code>&amp;quot;result&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;deleted&amp;quot;&lt;/code> only for a document that was live.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Batch document operation</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/bulk/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/document/bulk/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="batch-document-operation">
 Batch document operation
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#batch-document-operation">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Provides a efficient way to perform multiple &lt;code>index&lt;/code>, &lt;code>create&lt;/code>, &lt;code>delete&lt;/code>, and &lt;code>update&lt;/code>
operations in a single request.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_bulk
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;1&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;field1&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;value1&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;delete&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;2&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;create&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;3&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;field1&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;value3&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;update&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;1&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;doc&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;field2&amp;#34;&lt;/span> : &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;value2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The API returns the following result:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;took&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: 30,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;errors&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: false,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;items&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;index&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;created&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;delete&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,1&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;not_found&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;create&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;created&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;update&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="o">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;default:test&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0,0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;result&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;updated&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_bulk
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;/_bulk
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Optional, string) Name of the collection to target. Actions that don&amp;rsquo;t
explicitly specify their target in the action line use it.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h3 id="query-parameters">
 Query parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#query-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>realtime&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Optional, boolean, default: &lt;code>true&lt;/code>) Request-level write-mode switch that
overrides schema property-level realtime settings for every document in
this request: &lt;code>false&lt;/code> applies the batch WAL-only (durable immediately,
searchable after the offline epoch build).&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>key_as_id&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Optional, boolean, default: &lt;code>false&lt;/code>) compatibility rendering: keyed
documents answer with the user key AS &lt;code>_id&lt;/code> (see the index API).&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>sync_replication&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Optional, boolean) Opt back into synchronous inline replication for
this request (wait for the replica RPC and count it in the response).&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h3 id="request-body">
 Request body
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request-body">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>The actions are specified in the request body using a newline delimited JSON
(NDJSON) structure:&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>